      "text": "Sfera molto luminosa da dare a Dialga.\nPotenzia le mosse di tipo Drago e Acciaio.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A brightly gleaming orb to be held by Dialga.\nIt boosts the power of Dragon- and Steel-type\nmoves when it is held.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ディアルガに　持たせると　ドラゴンと\nはがねタイプの　技の　威力が\nあがる　光り　輝く　珠。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "让帝牙卢卡携带的话，\n龙和钢属性的招式威力就会提高。\n散发着光辉的宝珠。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una esfera brillante que potencia los movimientos de\ntipo Acero y Dragón. Debe llevarla Dialga.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
